From 0f210e13f6d76342b48b534b4f56c170c7ff20de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anselm Busse <anselm.busse@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 22:37:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/49] x86_64/fpu/587: x86_64-math-asm.h without fcomi

The underflow-forcing macros use fcomip/fucomip, which K1OM does not
have.  Use fcomp/fucomp, fnstsw and sahf like the other 587 files; %ax
is dead at every use.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Anselm Busse <anselm.busse@outlook.com>
---
 sysdeps/x86_64/fpu/587/x86_64-math-asm.h | 80 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 80 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sysdeps/x86_64/fpu/587/x86_64-math-asm.h

diff --git a/sysdeps/x86_64/fpu/587/x86_64-math-asm.h b/sysdeps/x86_64/fpu/587/x86_64-math-asm.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..502aeb7d4f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sysdeps/x86_64/fpu/587/x86_64-math-asm.h
@@ -0,0 +1,80 @@
